  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHEAR Studentship Cohort (SSC) programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SSC programme aims to complement and integrate further the current SHEAR-funded projects, with a particular focus on providing 12 students with opportunities to gain transferable skills, to conduct original and scientifically excellent research, and to contribute to impact creation beyond the existing SHEAR projects in Sub Saharan Africa and South Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
